1
00:01:32,690 --> 00:01:34,979
[OVERDO]

2
00:01:35,250 --> 00:01:37,820
[Episode 23]

3
00:01:39,870 --> 00:01:41,870
Those who wish to sever ties
with the family

4
00:01:41,870 --> 00:01:43,330
must suffer 3 stab wounds.

5
00:01:44,400 --> 00:01:45,600
The first stab today,

6
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:47,150
I give to myself.

7
00:01:47,840 --> 00:01:49,240
I cannot choose my birth,

8
00:01:49,920 --> 00:01:51,310
but I can at least

9
00:01:52,310 --> 00:01:54,039
choose how I live this life.

10
00:02:16,190 --> 00:02:17,120
Qingyu.

11
00:02:20,430 --> 00:02:22,630
In the past, I was despised by everyone.

12
00:02:23,430 --> 00:02:24,840
Only you wanted me.

13
00:02:27,630 --> 00:02:29,030
When I was framed,

14
00:02:30,430 --> 00:02:31,840
only you believed me.

15
00:02:34,310 --> 00:02:35,360
When the tendons

16
00:02:37,120 --> 00:02:38,750
in my hands were severed,

17
00:02:41,590 --> 00:02:42,630
only you

18
00:02:45,520 --> 00:02:47,650
tried to cure my hands till your death.

19
00:02:55,310 --> 00:02:56,120
Qingyu.

20
00:02:57,240 --> 00:02:58,190
I said

21
00:02:59,520 --> 00:03:01,080
I would protect you.

22
00:03:02,630 --> 00:03:04,150
I broke my promise.

23
00:03:13,470 --> 00:03:14,520
Let this stab

24
00:03:17,400 --> 00:03:18,560
be my apology.

25
00:03:45,630 --> 00:03:47,030
They all say that

26
00:03:49,240 --> 00:03:50,430
a family should be

27
00:03:51,870 --> 00:03:53,630
like a warm harbor.

28
00:03:59,079 --> 00:04:01,000
But since returning home at 12,

29
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:05,000
I've lived in hell every day.

30
00:04:08,310 --> 00:04:09,520
Without you,

31
00:04:11,190 --> 00:04:12,680
why linger in hell?

32
00:04:42,680 --> 00:04:43,800
This stab

33
00:04:46,360 --> 00:04:47,600
shall be the end

34
00:04:48,720 --> 00:04:50,360
of everything between us.

35
00:04:53,750 --> 00:04:54,510
Come on.

36
00:04:57,170 --> 00:04:59,880
[Funeral]

37
00:05:14,800 --> 00:05:15,680
Are you afraid?

38
00:05:24,560 --> 00:05:25,310
Come on!

39
00:05:36,800 --> 00:05:38,120
Who says I'm afraid?

40
00:06:19,720 --> 00:06:20,720
Cheng Jinzhi.

41
00:06:22,430 --> 00:06:23,720
From today on,

42
00:06:24,680 --> 00:06:25,630
ashes to ashes,

43
00:06:26,070 --> 00:06:27,070
dust to dust.

44
00:06:28,190 --> 00:06:30,070
We'll go our separate ways

45
00:06:32,430 --> 00:06:34,830
and have nothing more
to do with each other.

46
00:06:35,159 --> 00:06:36,760
I will also have nothing to do

47
00:06:37,510 --> 00:06:38,920
with the Murong family.

48
00:07:29,480 --> 00:07:30,140
Inspector,

49
00:07:30,800 --> 00:07:32,330
I found something unusual.

50
00:07:32,870 --> 00:07:33,480
Speak.

51
00:07:33,480 --> 00:07:34,480
As you ordered,

52
00:07:34,600 --> 00:07:36,800
I carefully searched the wedding hall.

53
00:07:37,390 --> 00:07:38,830
On the chair where the Marshal sat,

54
00:07:38,830 --> 00:07:39,680
I found this.

55
00:07:44,510 --> 00:07:45,770
A sniper rifle bullet?

56
00:07:45,870 --> 00:07:46,670
That's right.

57
00:07:47,040 --> 00:07:50,040
Huo Minxian's pistol
doesn't use this kind of bullet.

58
00:07:50,430 --> 00:07:53,040
This means there was
another shooter at the scene,

59
00:07:53,040 --> 00:07:54,370
targeting the Marshal.

60
00:07:54,800 --> 00:07:55,800
But...

61
00:07:55,800 --> 00:07:57,200
But no gunshot was heard.

62
00:07:59,000 --> 00:08:02,200
This means the sniper rifle
was equipped with a silencer.

63
00:08:04,830 --> 00:08:06,890
A gunsmith who can install a silencer

64
00:08:07,040 --> 00:08:07,830
without affecting

65
00:08:07,830 --> 00:08:09,560
the gun's accuracy

66
00:08:09,680 --> 00:08:11,410
is very rare in all of Nancheng.

67
00:08:11,630 --> 00:08:14,960
I'll investigate from the angle
of firearm modifications.

68
00:08:15,240 --> 00:08:15,870
Oh, right.

69
00:08:18,360 --> 00:08:19,560
Regarding Qingyi...

70
00:08:21,390 --> 00:08:22,990
And Ren Susu's whereabouts,

71
00:08:23,190 --> 00:08:24,870
let me know as soon as you find anything.

72
00:08:24,870 --> 00:08:25,600
Understood.

73
00:09:17,790 --> 00:09:18,720
Qingyi?

74
00:09:28,630 --> 00:09:29,960
During the wedding,

75
00:09:30,720 --> 00:09:32,320
what exactly were you doing?

76
00:09:37,320 --> 00:09:38,920
It has nothing to do with you.

77
00:09:42,270 --> 00:09:43,200
Ren Susu,

78
00:09:44,320 --> 00:09:46,850
if you hadn't insisted on
marrying Qingyu...

79
00:09:47,480 --> 00:09:48,790
If you hadn't

80
00:09:49,320 --> 00:09:50,790
lured Huo Minxian here...

81
00:09:51,750 --> 00:09:54,000
If you had died 3 years ago,

82
00:09:54,630 --> 00:09:56,270
Qingyu wouldn't have died!

83
00:09:58,910 --> 00:10:00,630
I wish the one who died

84
00:10:01,550 --> 00:10:03,080
was you, not him.

85
00:10:12,270 --> 00:10:13,510
If thinking

86
00:10:14,510 --> 00:10:15,390
and saying that

87
00:10:17,240 --> 00:10:19,640
can distract you
from your pain for a second

88
00:10:20,750 --> 00:10:22,210
and give you some comfort,

89
00:10:24,720 --> 00:10:25,790
then go ahead.

90
00:10:46,120 --> 00:10:47,270
Ren Susu,

91
00:10:49,240 --> 00:10:50,790
I'll ask you one last time.

92
00:10:56,790 --> 00:10:58,000
Did you ever love me?

93
00:11:12,440 --> 00:11:13,390
Three years ago,

94
00:11:15,600 --> 00:11:16,670
I meant it.

95
00:11:16,790 --> 00:11:17,750
What about now?

96
00:11:39,240 --> 00:11:41,080
I thought God treated me well

97
00:11:41,840 --> 00:11:43,150
by letting me meet you.

98
00:11:45,510 --> 00:11:47,710
I thought I could be like a normal person

99
00:11:48,480 --> 00:11:50,610
and have the right to love and be loved.

100
00:11:53,360 --> 00:11:54,150
Qingyi,

101
00:11:55,030 --> 00:11:56,150
let yourself go.

102
00:11:58,670 --> 00:12:00,080
Ren Susu, you know what?

103
00:12:01,550 --> 00:12:02,950
From the very beginning,

104
00:12:03,200 --> 00:12:04,480
I could never let go

105
00:12:06,510 --> 00:12:08,270
of the tiny sliver of hope

106
00:12:10,790 --> 00:12:12,920
that I could live like a normal person.

107
00:12:17,750 --> 00:12:18,750
But now,

108
00:12:20,000 --> 00:12:21,550
I think I can let it go.

109
00:12:50,550 --> 00:12:52,560
♪ The more passionate ♪

110
00:12:50,600 --> 00:12:51,600
Ren Susu,

111
00:12:52,580 --> 00:12:54,660
♪ Our past embrace ♪

112
00:12:54,200 --> 00:12:55,240
I hate you.

113
00:12:57,330 --> 00:12:59,150
♪ The more icy ♪

114
00:12:59,170 --> 00:13:01,240
♪ Our present clash ♪

115
00:13:03,090 --> 00:13:05,370
♪ If not tangled in love ♪

116
00:13:06,020 --> 00:13:08,730
♪ We are locked in hate ♪

117
00:13:09,760 --> 00:13:13,890
♪ There is no escaping it ♪

118
00:13:17,280 --> 00:13:19,110
♪ Sharper pain, deeper mark ♪

119
00:13:19,130 --> 00:13:21,310
♪ Deeper care, greater torment ♪

120
00:13:23,700 --> 00:13:25,650
♪ I won't give up on you ♪

121
00:13:25,670 --> 00:13:27,840
♪ Don't let go of me ♪

122
00:13:29,670 --> 00:13:32,430
♪ Let the ropes of fate ♪

123
00:13:32,460 --> 00:13:35,350
♪ Bind you and me ♪

124
00:13:36,230 --> 00:13:38,930
♪ Even if led to a precipice ♪

125
00:13:39,020 --> 00:13:41,460
♪ Together, we fall ♪

126
00:13:43,550 --> 00:13:45,280
♪ In exchange for my everything ♪

127
00:13:45,350 --> 00:13:47,240
♪ Will you finally be mine? ♪

128
00:13:47,850 --> 00:13:50,230
♪ Give me love and hate ♪

129
00:13:50,250 --> 00:13:53,830
♪ Let the tears fall,
let the blood spill ♪

130
00:13:53,850 --> 00:13:56,480
♪ Even through suffering,
I'll never let go of your hand ♪

131
00:13:56,860 --> 00:14:00,240
♪ I can't break free, I can't escape ♪

132
00:14:00,260 --> 00:14:02,760
♪ This, too, can be called
a lifetime together ♪

133
00:14:02,830 --> 00:14:04,010
♪ We ♪

134
00:14:04,780 --> 00:14:07,080
♪ Remain bound by fate until the end ♪

135
00:14:07,690 --> 00:14:13,470
♪ Forevermore ♪

136
00:14:50,320 --> 00:14:52,180
Murong Qingyi, stop right there!

137
00:14:52,200 --> 00:14:52,750
Go!

138
00:14:52,840 --> 00:14:53,750
Beat him up!

139
00:15:00,540 --> 00:15:02,840
Who gave you the nerve
to make Mother so angry?

140
00:15:02,840 --> 00:15:04,910
Beat him! Beat him to death!

141
00:15:13,470 --> 00:15:16,920
♪ Hate is the smoke left by dying flames ♪

142
00:15:13,550 --> 00:15:14,200
Stop!

143
00:15:16,720 --> 00:15:17,390
Qingyi!

144
00:15:17,280 --> 00:15:20,470
♪ Love is the warmth
lingering after the wildfire ♪

145
00:15:20,870 --> 00:15:24,250
♪ Love and hate collide in a blaze ♪

146
00:15:24,840 --> 00:15:28,110
♪ Devour me all ♪

147
00:15:28,130 --> 00:15:31,210
♪ Ahead lies
a tangle of joys and sorrows ♪

148
00:15:31,740 --> 00:15:34,570
♪ Behind remains
the bitterness of unspoken feelings ♪

149
00:15:35,210 --> 00:15:38,790
♪ The heart races with every thought ♪

150
00:15:38,810 --> 00:15:42,010
♪ As long as we loved each other,
I don't care ♪

151
00:15:42,090 --> 00:15:45,140
♪ If it's a blessing or a curse ♪

152
00:16:36,030 --> 00:16:36,840
Susu,

153
00:16:37,480 --> 00:16:39,670
you should live a good life.

154
00:16:41,000 --> 00:16:42,600
What counts as a good life?

155
00:16:43,240 --> 00:16:44,570
Being healthy and safe,

156
00:16:44,600 --> 00:16:46,550
following your heart's desires,

157
00:16:47,670 --> 00:16:49,870
immersing yourself in what you love...

158
00:16:51,080 --> 00:16:53,720
And if fate grants you the fortune

159
00:16:54,320 --> 00:16:56,320
to meet your destined one,

160
00:16:57,720 --> 00:16:59,440
being together day and night.

161
00:17:00,510 --> 00:17:01,750
This way,

162
00:17:00,580 --> 00:17:02,460
♪ I happened to ♪

163
00:17:02,150 --> 00:17:04,349
even ordinary things

164
00:17:02,480 --> 00:17:04,230
♪ Hear your name ♪

165
00:17:04,880 --> 00:17:07,400
and simple meals

166
00:17:05,619 --> 00:17:07,380
♪ And all the memories ♪

167
00:17:07,500 --> 00:17:10,380
♪ Came flooding back ♪

168
00:17:08,960 --> 00:17:10,440
can be filled with

169
00:17:10,960 --> 00:17:12,640
endless affection.

170
00:17:11,020 --> 00:17:13,180
♪ There I stood in the falling snow ♪

171
00:17:13,280 --> 00:17:15,690
♪ Wrapped in my coat ♪

172
00:17:15,310 --> 00:17:16,400
By this point,

173
00:17:16,300 --> 00:17:18,589
♪ My heart pounding ♪

174
00:17:17,480 --> 00:17:19,270
the scars,

175
00:17:19,589 --> 00:17:20,510
sorrows,

176
00:17:20,790 --> 00:17:22,349
♪ Walking down that old road ♪

177
00:17:21,069 --> 00:17:21,960
hatred,

178
00:17:22,369 --> 00:17:24,609
♪ Stopping every few steps ♪

179
00:17:22,400 --> 00:17:23,530
and fears of the past

180
00:17:24,160 --> 00:17:25,160
will all fade away

181
00:17:25,750 --> 00:17:27,500
♪ In the misty train car ♪

182
00:17:25,750 --> 00:17:27,400
like passing clouds.

183
00:17:27,630 --> 00:17:30,820
♪ I wish I could ask you once more ♪

184
00:17:32,180 --> 00:17:36,070
♪ If you have any ♪

185
00:17:33,480 --> 00:17:34,510
Qingyi...

186
00:17:36,160 --> 00:17:38,470
♪ New corny jokes to tell ♪

187
00:17:36,160 --> 00:17:37,270
Don't be afraid.

188
00:18:36,790 --> 00:18:37,590
You're awake.

189
00:18:47,070 --> 00:18:48,310
You saved me?

190
00:18:49,110 --> 00:18:50,040
Where is Qingyi?

191
00:18:50,270 --> 00:18:51,030
He's fine.

192
00:18:51,550 --> 00:18:53,010
I sent him to the hospital.

193
00:18:53,830 --> 00:18:56,160
You'd better worry about yourself first.

194
00:18:56,440 --> 00:18:57,700
You're badly injured.

195
00:19:00,350 --> 00:19:01,110
Thank you.

196
00:19:03,550 --> 00:19:04,410
Don't thank me.

197
00:19:04,920 --> 00:19:06,120
Death would have been

198
00:19:06,590 --> 00:19:07,590
too easy on you.

199
00:19:09,550 --> 00:19:10,480
What do you mean?

200
00:19:14,480 --> 00:19:16,540
Have you seen this before, Miss Fang?

201
00:19:20,590 --> 00:19:22,640
I found it in the wedding hall.

202
00:19:55,400 --> 00:19:57,060
Back then, you wanted to shoot

203
00:19:57,510 --> 00:19:59,040
and assassinate my father.

204
00:20:00,550 --> 00:20:02,550
But Huo Minxian suddenly appeared.

205
00:20:03,680 --> 00:20:05,810
My father turned around to check on her

206
00:20:06,070 --> 00:20:08,400
and narrowly escaped the assassination.

207
00:20:11,200 --> 00:20:12,720
I only realized today that

208
00:20:13,920 --> 00:20:15,320
on the day of the wedding,

209
00:20:15,830 --> 00:20:18,030
I almost lost 2 of my closest relatives.

210
00:20:21,270 --> 00:20:22,240
Miss Ren.

211
00:20:22,960 --> 00:20:24,550
Please explain

212
00:20:25,640 --> 00:20:26,970
your vicious behavior.

213
00:20:33,110 --> 00:20:35,040
I just wanted to kill Li Rongzhang.

214
00:20:36,680 --> 00:20:37,750
I wanted to before,

215
00:20:39,400 --> 00:20:40,860
and I want to even more now.

216
00:20:43,750 --> 00:20:44,790
Li Rongzhang...

217
00:20:46,920 --> 00:20:47,590
Deserves to die.

218
00:20:47,590 --> 00:20:48,440
Ren Susu.

219
00:20:52,550 --> 00:20:54,550
My father has no grudge against you.

220
00:20:57,110 --> 00:20:58,480
No grudge?

221
00:21:00,160 --> 00:21:01,400
Twelve years ago,

222
00:21:02,310 --> 00:21:04,440
the North-South Railway bombing case

223
00:21:04,830 --> 00:21:07,160
claimed nearly a hundred innocent lives.

224
00:21:07,240 --> 00:21:08,640
If we talk about grudges,

225
00:21:10,240 --> 00:21:12,310
Li Rongzhang doesn't have enough
to answer for.

226
00:21:12,310 --> 00:21:13,200
Nonsense!

227
00:21:14,440 --> 00:21:16,230
The North-South Railway bombing case

228
00:21:16,230 --> 00:21:17,830
was settled long ago.

229
00:21:18,640 --> 00:21:19,440
You have no proof;

230
00:21:19,440 --> 00:21:21,030
how can you blame my father?

231
00:21:24,270 --> 00:21:25,200
Inspector Li.

232
00:21:27,270 --> 00:21:28,640
When Qingyu was alive,

233
00:21:29,440 --> 00:21:30,840
he said you were upright,

234
00:21:30,960 --> 00:21:32,310
but lacked decisiveness.

235
00:21:32,310 --> 00:21:33,400
He was right.

236
00:21:33,750 --> 00:21:36,080
You only believe what you want to believe.

237
00:21:40,750 --> 00:21:42,410
How dare you mention him to me?

238
00:21:46,110 --> 00:21:47,000
Answer me.

239
00:21:48,510 --> 00:21:49,310
Is Huo Minxian

240
00:21:50,750 --> 00:21:52,030
related to you?

241
00:21:52,550 --> 00:21:53,440
Was Qingyu

242
00:21:55,550 --> 00:21:57,160
killed by you?

243
00:22:05,070 --> 00:22:06,110
Qingyu's death

244
00:22:07,000 --> 00:22:08,350
was not in my plan.

245
00:22:09,880 --> 00:22:10,790
I also don't know why Huo Minxian

246
00:22:10,790 --> 00:22:11,920
suddenly appeared.

247
00:22:13,960 --> 00:22:15,960
If you really want to avenge Qingyu,

248
00:22:16,590 --> 00:22:18,310
you should investigate Huo Minxian

249
00:22:18,310 --> 00:22:20,110
instead of wasting your time
arguing with me.

250
00:22:20,110 --> 00:22:22,040
You're still muddying the waters.

251
00:22:22,310 --> 00:22:24,590
Do you really think I wouldn't shoot you?

252
00:22:27,160 --> 00:22:29,070
In our original plan,

253
00:22:31,480 --> 00:22:33,110
I was supposed to die.

254
00:22:53,770 --> 00:22:55,640
[Ji'an Hospital]

255
00:22:56,870 --> 00:23:00,210
[Ji'an Hospital]

256
00:23:20,740 --> 00:23:22,850
[Murong Qingyu was martyred]

257
00:23:22,870 --> 00:23:26,150
[Aviation school left without an owner,
future uncertain]

258
00:23:37,200 --> 00:23:38,400
Young Master Qingyi,

259
00:23:38,590 --> 00:23:39,390
you're awake.

260
00:23:46,400 --> 00:23:47,660
How did I get back here?

261
00:23:49,160 --> 00:23:51,420
You had already fainted when I found you.

262
00:23:51,790 --> 00:23:53,120
You were badly injured.

263
00:23:58,270 --> 00:23:59,480
Was I alone?

264
00:24:00,240 --> 00:24:01,000
Yes.

265
00:24:10,070 --> 00:24:11,000
I knew it.

266
00:24:19,000 --> 00:24:20,160
We will never

267
00:24:22,880 --> 00:24:24,740
see each other again in this life.

268
00:24:26,830 --> 00:24:27,640
So be it.

269
00:24:30,720 --> 00:24:31,270
Move.

270
00:24:32,400 --> 00:24:33,240
Let me in.

271
00:24:33,960 --> 00:24:34,880
Move!

272
00:24:35,440 --> 00:24:36,590
Who's outside?

273
00:24:36,720 --> 00:24:37,880
It's Ms. Ye.

274
00:24:38,310 --> 00:24:39,570
I had someone stop her.

275
00:24:39,720 --> 00:24:40,580
Murong Qingyi!

276
00:24:44,220 --> 00:24:45,020
[Murong Qingyu was martyred]

277
00:24:45,040 --> 00:24:46,190
[Aviation school left without an owner,
future uncertain]

278
00:24:53,680 --> 00:24:54,550
Murong Qingyi.

279
00:24:55,920 --> 00:24:56,830
We need you.

280
00:25:01,830 --> 00:25:03,490
I'm already a useless person.

281
00:25:04,270 --> 00:25:05,400
How can I help you?

282
00:25:07,750 --> 00:25:11,010
Now, various forces
want to take over the aviation school.

283
00:25:11,030 --> 00:25:12,400
Li Rongzhang even
gathered a bunch of people

284
00:25:12,400 --> 00:25:14,260
to surround the aviation school.

285
00:25:15,510 --> 00:25:17,960
But the aviation school
is not privately owned.

286
00:25:17,960 --> 00:25:19,400
In the past, it was just a hot potato

287
00:25:19,400 --> 00:25:20,800
that everyone despised.

288
00:25:22,350 --> 00:25:24,410
Qingyu took over the aviation school

289
00:25:25,240 --> 00:25:26,510
and put in so much work

290
00:25:27,590 --> 00:25:28,680
to turn the school

291
00:25:29,240 --> 00:25:30,640
into what it is today.

292
00:25:31,920 --> 00:25:34,920
If we let Li Rongzhang and the others
do what they want,

293
00:25:35,000 --> 00:25:37,060
the aviation school will fall apart.

294
00:25:41,350 --> 00:25:42,310
So what?

295
00:25:45,310 --> 00:25:47,030
Isn't it good if it falls apart?

296
00:25:47,030 --> 00:25:47,550
You...

297
00:25:58,030 --> 00:25:59,030
Your brother

298
00:25:59,550 --> 00:26:01,920
devoted his heart and soul
to the aviation school.

299
00:26:01,920 --> 00:26:05,580
Are we really going to let others
take advantage of the situation?

300
00:26:08,000 --> 00:26:09,310
What's the point

301
00:26:12,200 --> 00:26:13,440
of saying this now?

302
00:26:14,000 --> 00:26:15,060
Of course there is!

303
00:26:17,920 --> 00:26:19,830
The current few batches of students
at the aviation school

304
00:26:19,830 --> 00:26:21,750
are exceptionally well-trained.

305
00:26:21,750 --> 00:26:23,680
Disregarding combat experience,

306
00:26:23,680 --> 00:26:26,940
their quality is comparable to that
of a regular air force.

307
00:26:27,000 --> 00:26:28,200
If they are disbanded

308
00:26:28,400 --> 00:26:28,960
or used

309
00:26:29,270 --> 00:26:31,130
by people with ulterior motives,

310
00:26:31,750 --> 00:26:34,270
-Qingyu's spirit won't be at ease.
-Enough.

311
00:26:37,510 --> 00:26:38,830
When Qingyu was alive,

312
00:26:40,070 --> 00:26:42,310
he never thought about himself
for a single day.

313
00:26:42,310 --> 00:26:43,350
You people

314
00:26:43,640 --> 00:26:47,110
always pressured him with family
responsibilities and national duties.

315
00:26:47,110 --> 00:26:48,750
Now that he's dead,

316
00:26:50,200 --> 00:26:51,640
can't he rest?

317
00:27:13,200 --> 00:27:14,000
Okay.

318
00:27:17,720 --> 00:27:19,070
I see what you mean.

319
00:27:33,880 --> 00:27:35,200
Qingyu is gone.

320
00:27:38,590 --> 00:27:40,110
If his legacy

321
00:27:40,830 --> 00:27:42,310
disappears as well,

322
00:27:43,880 --> 00:27:45,880
he'd truly be forgotten.

323
00:27:54,760 --> 00:27:58,780
[Special Care Unit]

324
00:27:58,880 --> 00:27:59,510
Wait.

325
00:28:04,680 --> 00:28:05,440
I'll go.

326
00:28:48,650 --> 00:28:54,640
[Tongde Hospital]

327
00:29:16,590 --> 00:29:17,510
I'm sorry.

328
00:29:20,200 --> 00:29:22,000
I didn't know you were pregnant.

329
00:29:28,830 --> 00:29:30,490
Why didn't you tell me earlier

330
00:29:31,000 --> 00:29:33,460
that you were pregnant
with Qingyu's child?

331
00:29:36,400 --> 00:29:37,330
What did you say?

332
00:29:39,440 --> 00:29:40,200
Don't worry.

333
00:29:41,440 --> 00:29:43,500
The doctor did everything they could

334
00:29:43,830 --> 00:29:44,890
and saved the baby.

335
00:29:55,160 --> 00:29:56,090
Sister-in-law,

336
00:29:56,720 --> 00:29:57,790
as long as I'm here,

337
00:29:58,830 --> 00:30:00,510
I won't let anyone bully you.

338
00:30:01,310 --> 00:30:03,710
I will definitely protect you
and the baby.

339
00:30:11,640 --> 00:30:12,680
You should go.

340
00:30:13,920 --> 00:30:15,520
I want to be alone for a while.

341
00:31:05,270 --> 00:31:06,070
Inspector Li.

342
00:31:06,750 --> 00:31:08,880
The mother and the fetus are both fine.

343
00:31:09,310 --> 00:31:11,000
They just need a good rest.

344
00:31:11,440 --> 00:31:12,240
However,

345
00:31:12,400 --> 00:31:13,310
this lady

346
00:31:13,310 --> 00:31:15,510
has severe damage to her right cochlea.

347
00:31:15,880 --> 00:31:16,680
I'm afraid

348
00:31:16,920 --> 00:31:19,180
she will suffer permanent hearing loss.

349
00:31:20,680 --> 00:31:22,280
Is there really no other way?

350
00:31:24,960 --> 00:31:27,360
The chances of a full recovery
are very low.

351
00:31:27,480 --> 00:31:28,410
Director Zhang.

352
00:31:29,880 --> 00:31:31,140
Regarding what you saw

353
00:31:31,510 --> 00:31:32,470
and heard today,

354
00:31:33,400 --> 00:31:34,860
please keep them a secret.

355
00:31:36,440 --> 00:31:37,240
I understand.

356
00:31:59,960 --> 00:32:00,750
Qingyu.

357
00:32:01,830 --> 00:32:02,680
Don't worry.

358
00:32:03,920 --> 00:32:06,580
Since I promised you
to take care of this family,

359
00:32:06,920 --> 00:32:09,180
I will definitely keep your unborn child

360
00:32:09,240 --> 00:32:10,480
safe.

361
00:32:16,660 --> 00:32:20,700
[Two months later]

362
00:32:21,920 --> 00:32:23,050
News Agency Briefs.

363
00:32:23,920 --> 00:32:26,750
Murong Qingyi will carry out
his brother's last wishes.

364
00:32:26,750 --> 00:32:29,240
He plans to lead several student soldiers
from the aviation school

365
00:32:29,240 --> 00:32:32,150
to the southwestern front in 3 days

366
00:32:32,550 --> 00:32:34,750
to answer the nation's
special wartime call-up

367
00:32:34,750 --> 00:32:36,280
and support the war effort.

368
00:32:39,640 --> 00:32:40,570
Sister-in-law.

369
00:32:41,240 --> 00:32:42,100
The doctor said

370
00:32:42,310 --> 00:32:45,040
a quiet environment
is better for your recovery.

371
00:33:00,110 --> 00:33:00,920
I know

372
00:33:02,270 --> 00:33:03,350
you're angry.

373
00:33:06,790 --> 00:33:08,240
Qingyu died suddenly.

374
00:33:09,110 --> 00:33:10,110
Like you,

375
00:33:11,590 --> 00:33:12,590
I am also very sad.

376
00:33:14,590 --> 00:33:16,390
That's why I did the stupid thing

377
00:33:16,880 --> 00:33:18,810
of interrogating you for answers.

378
00:33:20,110 --> 00:33:22,440
So, you must take good care
of your health.

379
00:33:22,550 --> 00:33:24,410
I will definitely be responsible

380
00:33:25,310 --> 00:33:27,040
for you and the child's future.

381
00:33:27,510 --> 00:33:29,720
What if this child isn't Qingyu's?

382
00:33:33,270 --> 00:33:34,200
What do you mean?

383
00:33:34,960 --> 00:33:35,960
I mean,

384
00:33:38,680 --> 00:33:40,590
