385
00:33:41,400 --> 00:33:43,660
will you still be responsible to the end?

386
00:33:47,070 --> 00:33:48,400
You betrayed Qingyu?

387
00:33:53,310 --> 00:33:55,000
There had never been any affection

388
00:33:55,000 --> 00:33:56,270
between Qingyu and me.

389
00:33:58,240 --> 00:33:59,110
This child

390
00:34:01,270 --> 00:34:02,720
is Murong Qingyi's.

391
00:34:08,800 --> 00:34:10,440
Triumph for our heroes,

392
00:34:10,710 --> 00:34:12,400
safe return for all!

